               <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Matching is computed on the RF-Track model, so the model must have the same optics as the machine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Download the quadrupole currents from the machine and load them into the model before computing the matching. Quadrupoles that are not used for matching keep these currents.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
              </property>
